OpenCPN 5.14.2 for AmigaOS 3: build with OpenGL off. Charts are drawn with wxDC. The GL canvas header becomes a name only, and the GL headers give the GL types and GLU's tesselator, which the region and S-52 code use either way, on systems other than GTK and Qt too.

